bab["2"] = {"tipe": "faq", "sumber": ["ed"], "butir": [
 {"t": L("Apa itu kredit karbon?", "What is a carbon credit?"), "j": L("Satu unit yang mewakili penurunan atau penghindaran satu ton CO2e dan sudah diverifikasi pihak ketiga. Unit itu dicatat di registri, boleh dijual, lalu dipensiunkan (dipakai) oleh pembelinya sehingga tidak bisa dijual lagi.", "A unit representing one tonne of CO2e reduced or avoided and verified by a third party. It is recorded in a registry, can be sold, and is then retired (used) by its buyer so it cannot be sold again.")},
 {"t": L("Apa beda pajak karbon, ETS, dan offset?", "What is the difference between a carbon tax, an ETS and offsets?"), "j": L("Pajak karbon menetapkan harga per ton emisi. ETS menetapkan batas emisi lalu mengizinkan pelaku yang melebihi batas membeli unit dari yang di bawah batas. Offset adalah kredit dari proyek di luar batas itu yang dibeli untuk mengimbangi emisi.", "A carbon tax sets a price per tonne of emissions. An ETS sets an emissions cap and lets those above the cap buy units from those below it. Offsets are credits from projects outside the cap that are bought to compensate emissions.")},
 {"t": L("Apakah pajak karbon sudah berlaku di Indonesia?", "Is a carbon tax already in force in Indonesia?"), "j": L("Seri harga karbon yang dipakai halaman ini mencatat Indonesia tanpa pajak karbon dan dengan ETS pada {tahun_luar}. Tarif minimal Rp30 per kg CO2e tercatat di UU 7/2021 Pasal 13, tetapi naskah dan aturan turunannya belum ada di korpus METI, jadi cek penerapan terbarunya ke sumber resmi.", "The carbon price series used on this page records Indonesia with an ETS and no carbon tax in {tahun_luar}. A minimum rate of Rp30 per kg CO2e is noted in Law 7/2021 Article 13, but the text and its implementing rules are not in the METI corpus, so check the latest application with official sources.")},
 {"t": L("Berapa harga unit karbon di IDXCarbon?", "What do carbon units cost on IDXCarbon?"), "j": L("Harga rata-rata tertimbang bulan {bursa_bln} adalah Rp{bursa_harga} per tCO2e, dihitung dari nilai dibagi volume. Selama {bursa_n} bulan laporan, rata-rata bulanan bergerak antara Rp{harga_min} dan Rp{harga_maks}. Ini bukan harga kutipan karena bursa tidak menerbitkan harga per unit.", "The weighted average price in {bursa_bln} was Rp{bursa_harga} per tCO2e, computed as value divided by volume. Over {bursa_n} reporting months the monthly average ranged between Rp{harga_min} and Rp{harga_maks}. This is not a quoted price because the exchange does not publish per-unit prices.")},
 {"t": L("Siapa yang boleh menjual unit karbon?", "Who can sell carbon units?"), "j": L("Pemilik proyek yang unitnya sudah tercatat di Sistem Registri Nasional dan terdaftar di bursa, seperti daftar proyek yang tampil di bab Proyek. Syarat rincinya ada di Perpres 110/2025 dan aturan turunannya; naskah turunan belum ada di korpus METI.", "Project owners whose units are recorded in the National Registry System and listed on the exchange, like the projects shown in the Projects chapter. Detailed requirements are in Presidential Regulation 110/2025 and its implementing rules; those rules are not yet in the METI corpus.")},
 {"t": L("Apakah PLTS bisa menghasilkan kredit karbon?", "Can a solar plant earn carbon credits?"), "j": L("Bisa bila penurunan emisinya tambahan (additional), diukur dengan metodologi yang diakui seperti ACM0002 untuk listrik tersambung jaringan, dan diverifikasi. Di registri Verra dan Gold Standard, proyek surya Indonesia masih sedikit dibanding hidro dan panas bumi.", "Yes, if the emission reduction is additional, measured with a recognized methodology such as ACM0002 for grid-connected electricity, and verified. In the Verra and Gold Standard registries, Indonesian solar projects are still few compared with hydro and geothermal.")},
 {"t": L("Apa beda kredit di IDXCarbon dan di Verra atau Gold Standard?", "How do IDXCarbon credits differ from Verra or Gold Standard ones?"), "j": L("IDXCarbon memperdagangkan unit domestik yang tercatat di SRN PPI dengan seri SPE. Verra dan Gold Standard adalah registri sukarela internasional dengan metodologi dan penerbitan sendiri. Satu proyek bisa muncul di keduanya, jadi periksa agar tidak ada penghitungan ganda.", "IDXCarbon trades domestic units recorded in SRN PPI with SPE series numbers. Verra and Gold Standard are international voluntary registries with their own methodologies and issuance. One project can appear in both, so check that nothing is counted twice.")},
 {"t": L("Apa itu additionality dan kenapa menentukan?", "What is additionality and why does it decide everything?"), "j": L("Penurunan emisi dihitung hanya bila tidak akan terjadi tanpa insentif karbon. Tanpa itu, kredit mewakili emisi yang memang sudah akan turun dan integritasnya dipertanyakan.", "An emission reduction counts only if it would not have happened without carbon incentives. Without that, a credit represents emissions that were going to fall anyway and its integrity is questioned.")},
 {"t": L("Dari mana angka faktor emisi listrik berasal?", "Where do grid emission factors come from?"), "j": L("Halaman ini menurunkan intensitas emisi tiap sistem PLN dari tabel RUPTL 2025-2034 (emisi GRK dibagi produksi listrik), lalu memberi label EST. Faktor emisi resmi ESDM per sistem belum ada di korpus METI, jadi angka resmi harus dipakai untuk dokumen proyek.", "This page derives the emission intensity of each PLN system from the RUPTL 2025-2034 tables (GHG emissions divided by electricity production) and labels it EST. The official ESDM emission factor per system is not yet in the METI corpus, so official figures must be used for project documents.")},
 {"t": L("Apa yang bisa dilakukan anggota METI sekarang?", "What can METI members do now?"), "j": L("Pengembang bisa menyiapkan dokumentasi pengukuran sejak desain, investor memasukkan harga karbon sebagai skenario, dan pemda menyelaraskan rencana aksi daerah. Rincinya ada di bab Peluang dan tantangan serta Daftar yang harus dilakukan.", "Developers can prepare measurement documentation from the design stage, investors can model carbon prices as scenarios, and local governments can align regional action plans. Details are in the Opportunities and Things to do chapters.")},
]}
G = [
 ("NDC","Kontribusi yang ditetapkan secara nasional di bawah Persetujuan Paris: janji penurunan emisi tiap negara. Angka Indonesia: {ndc_min} persen dengan upaya sendiri dan {ndc_maks} persen dengan dukungan internasional pada 2030 (E-NDC 2022).","Nationally Determined Contribution under the Paris Agreement: each country's emission reduction pledge. Indonesia's figures: {ndc_min} percent unconditional and {ndc_maks} percent with international support by 2030 (E-NDC 2022)."),
 ("ETS","Sistem perdagangan emisi: pemerintah membatasi emisi total, pelaku menerima atau membeli izin, dan kelebihan atau kekurangan izin diperdagangkan.","Emissions trading system: the government caps total emissions, participants receive or buy allowances, and surplus or shortfall allowances are traded."),
 ("Offset","Kredit dari proyek di luar batas emisi pembeli, dibeli untuk mengimbangi emisinya.","Credits from projects outside the buyer's emission cap, bought to compensate its emissions."),
 ("tCO2e","Satu ton setara karbon dioksida; satuan umum untuk menjumlahkan beragam gas rumah kaca.","One tonne of carbon dioxide equivalent; the common unit for adding up different greenhouse gases."),
 ("PTBAE-PU","Persetujuan teknis batas atas emisi pelaku usaha: batas emisi yang dipakai pada ETS Indonesia untuk pembangkit listrik.","Technical approval of a business actor's emission cap: the cap used in Indonesia's ETS for power plants."),
 ("SPE-GRK","Sertifikat penurunan emisi gas rumah kaca; unit yang tercatat di registri nasional dan bisa diperdagangkan di bursa karbon.","Greenhouse gas emission reduction certificate; the unit recorded in the national registry and tradable on the carbon exchange."),
 ("SRN PPI","Sistem Registri Nasional Pengendalian Perubahan Iklim: pencatatan aksi dan unit karbon nasional.","National Registry System for Climate Change Control: the national record of climate actions and carbon units."),
 ("MRV","Measurement, reporting, verification: mengukur, melaporkan, dan memverifikasi emisi atau penurunannya.","Measurement, reporting, verification of emissions or their reduction."),
 ("LVV","Lembaga validasi dan verifikasi: pihak ketiga independen yang memeriksa desain dan hasil proyek.","Validation and verification body: an independent third party that checks a project's design and results."),
 ("Additionality","Syarat bahwa penurunan emisi hanya terjadi karena insentif karbon.","The requirement that the reduction happens only because of carbon incentives."),
 ("Baseline","Perkiraan emisi bila proyek tidak ada; penurunan dihitung dari selisihnya dengan emisi proyek.","The estimated emissions without the project; the reduction is the difference from project emissions."),
 ("Faktor emisi grid","Emisi per MWh listrik jaringan (tCO2e per MWh) yang dipakai untuk menghitung emisi terhindar oleh pembangkit bersih.","Emissions per MWh of grid electricity (tCO2e per MWh) used to compute emissions avoided by clean generation."),
 ("Vintage","Tahun penurunan emisi yang diwakili sebuah unit karbon.","The year of the emission reduction a carbon unit represents."),
 ("Pensiun unit","Unit dipakai pembelinya dan dikeluarkan dari peredaran sehingga tidak bisa dijual lagi.","The unit is used by its buyer and removed from circulation so it cannot be sold again."),
 ("CORSIA","Skema ICAO yang mewajibkan maskapai penerbangan internasional mengimbangi pertumbuhan emisinya dengan unit karbon.","The ICAO scheme requiring international airlines to offset emissions growth with carbon units."),
 ("Article 6","Pasal 6 Persetujuan Paris tentang kerja sama pasar karbon antarnegara.","Article 6 of the Paris Agreement on cross-border carbon market cooperation."),
 ("ITMO","Internationally transferred mitigation outcome: hasil mitigasi yang dipindahkan antarnegara di bawah Pasal 6.2.","Internationally transferred mitigation outcome: a mitigation result transferred between countries under Article 6.2."),
 ("Net zero","Keseimbangan antara emisi yang dilepas dan yang diserap atau dihindari. Indonesia menyebut sasaran 2060 di KEN PP 40/2025.","A balance between emissions released and those removed or avoided. Indonesia states a 2060 goal in KEN, Government Regulation 40/2025."),
]
